  "notes": "Adds contour-distance/directional bevel fitting on the two lower column plaques; makes paired top fans exactly symmetric; keeps shaft shading independent and highlights intact. Horizontal fan rail retains its depth ramp with consistent bands. Empty-margin trimming is exact and makes no additional visual changes. Explicit nine-slice frame decomposition and one shared learned gold bevel model. Central crown/title remains one larger ornament instead of arbitrary fragments. Whole button surrounds reduce command/record fragmentation. A shared contour model reconstructs the gold frame with a uniform face; original symbols are restored unchanged. Icon bounds are derived from all cream/gray source pixels in protected face ROIs; this corrects antialias fringes missed by initial boxes.",
